    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but the professional stuff doesnt help with this specific feeling. it's not just sadness. it's like the person who used to live in my head is gone, and there's just this empty, hollow shell left. if there's no real \"me\" there anymore to experience anything... what's even the point of trying to hold on to a ghost?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
